# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What ESA DEPLOYS is a subset of what ESA KEEPS.
#
# Vercel serves this repository as a static site, so without this file every
# committed .html becomes a public page the moment it is pushed. That is how
# nine research documents ended up publicly readable and indexable: nobody
# published them, the host did.
#
# This file is the serving boundary. Everything listed here STAYS in the
# repository and in git history — it is simply not uploaded to the deployment,
# so it has no URL. Nothing is deleted and nothing moves, so no reference or
# history changes.
#
# Adding a file here is the correct way to keep research, prototypes, source
# material and tooling in ESA without publishing it. Removing a file from here
# is a publication decision and goes through publication-gate/.
#
# Verify after any deploy: the paths below must return 404.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Research, prototypes and source material ────────────────────────────────
# Institutional and product research. Kept deliberately; not ESA publications.
research/

# ── Migrated source folder (also gitignored, listed for intent) ─────────────
Education/

# ── ESA pilot admin — owner ruling 2026-09-15 (Option A) ────────────────────
# The admin UI is a client shell: the key is typed each visit, held in memory, and
# verified server-side against ESA_ADMIN_KEY by the esa-review function. No pilot
# data was ever exposed without the key — what was public was the surface itself.
# Excluding it removes that surface. The source stays tracked here; administration
# is local-only (serve the repo and open http://localhost:PORT/esa/admin.html —
# the function's CORS is `*`).
#
# This does NOT remove the admin endpoint: anyone can POST {action:"admin", key}
# to the function regardless. ESA_ADMIN_KEY is and remains the real security
# boundary. See publication-gate/HARDENING-BACKLOG.md.
esa/admin.html
esa/admin.js

# ── Tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
publication-gate/

# ── Product source that is not the product ──────────────────────────────────
# Edge-function source, the evaluation harness, gold fixtures, migrations and
# the deploy/ops scripts. The product is the page and its client, not these.
assignment-studio/functions/
assignment-studio/harness/
assignment-studio/gold/
assignment-studio/sql/
assignment-studio/deploy.mjs
assignment-studio/deploy-esa.mjs
assignment-studio/migrate-to-esa-project.mjs
assignment-studio/esa-anthropic-key.mjs
assignment-studio/esa-backend-smoke.mjs

# Pilot test scaffolding — not part of the invited pilot surface.
esa/review/dom-smoke.mjs
esa/review/fixtures/
esa/review/README.md
esa/review/PILOT-PRE-REGISTRATION.md

# ── Repository documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────
CLAUDE.md
README.md
assignment-studio/README.md
css/README.md
